---

<section
  id="rosto-massagem"
  class="bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] pt-12 pb-16 px-6 lg:px-12 scroll-mt-28 sm:scroll-mt-36"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div
      class="flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-5 mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/25"
    >
      <span
        class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[var(--cor-secundaria)] font-light leading-none"
        >05</span
      >
      <div>
        <h2
          class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-tight mb-1.5"
        >
          Bem-Estar
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light">
          Protocolos de circulação, desintoxicação e bem-estar
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-7 items-stretch"
    >
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)]/40 shadow-xs hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.06)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-300 mb-1.5 leading-snug"
          >
            Pressoterapia
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-[var(--cor-secundaria)] uppercase tracking-[1.5px] mb-3"
          >
            Circulação e Retenção
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light mb-8"
          >
            Tratamento mecânico pneumático que estimula a circulação venosa e
            linfática, reduz a sensação de pernas pesadas e combate a retenção.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light"
          >
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              class="w-3.5 h-3.5 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[1.5]"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>40 min</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+marcar+Pressoterapia+na+Klassy."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--cor-destaque)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            <span>Marcar</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group relative bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)]/40 shadow-xs hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.06)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-300 mb-1.5 leading-snug"
          >
            Drenagem Linfática por Ionização
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-[var(--cor-destaque)] uppercase tracking-[1.5px] mb-3"
          >
            Desintoxicação e Bem-Estar
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light mb-8"
          >
            Tratamento que combina drenagem linfática com microcorrentes de
            ionização para potenciar a eliminação de toxinas, reduzir edemas e
            melhorar a tonicidade da pele.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light"
          >
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              class="w-3.5 h-3.5 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[1.5]"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>45–60 min</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+marcar+Drenagem+Linf%C3%A1tica+por+Ioniza%C3%A7%C3%A3o+na+Klassy."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--cor-destaque)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            <span>Marcar</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-14 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 max-w-3xl mx-auto shadow-2xs text-center"
    >
      <p
        class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light leading-relaxed"
      >
        Se procura um serviço à medida, pacotes mensais, noivas ou grupos?
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+saber+mais+sobre+pacotes+personalizados+na+Klassy."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-medium text-[var(--cor-destaque)] hover:underline decoration-[var(--cor-secundaria)] underline-offset-2 ml-1"
        >
          Fale connosco no WhatsApp
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>